        {
          "name": "Out Decoded Block",
          "type": "FMutableMemoryView"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "FIoChunkBlockDecodeResult",
      "docs": "Decode a single I/O store chunk block.\n@param Params\t\t\tControls whether this function:\n- computes and verifys the block signature using the provided block hash\n- decrypts the block using the provided encryption key\n- decompress the source buffer to the destinatino buffer\n@param EncodedBlock\t\tMemory view of the encoded source buffer. Assumes the underlying size is aligned to AES block size.\n@param OutDecodedBlock\tMemory view of the destination buffer.\n@note This function does not copy the bytes from the encoded block unless it is compressed."
    },
